nt to point.", "short_description": "Armed with a firework rocket launcher, you must defend your temples from hordes of snake like creatures.  The snakes come from another dimension with one aim in mind, to destroy temples and harness the energy of your world. But these creatures have a weakness, fireworks! \nDefend 14 levels spanning a variety of landscapes from mist covered mountain tops, snowy peaks, and exotic waterfalls. Be treated with your personal firework show as each level is cleared."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.vurrealgames.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.vurrealgames.com/", "publisher_name": "Vurreal Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.vormholes.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ADVENTURE", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD", "GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "309178907917720"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974644_348590852636656_7169743818093232128_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LYoNNfXqkDAQ7kNvwHkV6vQ&_nc_oc=AdnAHdUXhoCd9BpC_Uj_u022Gfrz6gVnQbqRp0OVcOAdpAr1_yHUb6UG3Z5aPAZvJao&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyHNYDns8S2fj1W6hn8iyeqy0KZ_TSkwImC--aJBvzALw&oe=69B7ECC9"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "VormHoles", "platform": "ANDROID", "context_category": null, "context_t